# Ship local billing changes

When you change this app, finish by updating the live site and GitHub. Do this in the same turn as the change, without waiting to be asked.

Live site: CT 118 `nicks-billing` on home-media (`10.0.0.20`), UI `http://10.0.0.60:8787`. Replace the whole tree with `deploy/install.sh` from a copy on the host (`SRC_DIR=/root/nicks-billing-src`). Do not copy individual files into the container. The guest keeps `/etc/nicks-billing.env`. Leave out `.env`, `ground_truth/`, photos, and `scripts/load_roster_sheets.py`.

GitHub: commit and push `main` to `https://github.com/BasicOverflow/nicks_lawn_care_billing`. Include the app change. Do not commit `.env`, sheet photos, gold JSON, or scripts that contain client names, addresses, phones, or emails. Do not force-push.
